      "problem": "BLOCKING evidence/workflow defect at python.isolated_environments@python_fastapi_backend_developer: f4 and final teaching blocks tb3/tb5 prescribe 'where python on Windows', but the cited https://tiangolo.com/guides/virtual-environments/#check-it-is-active uses Get-Command python in its Windows PowerShell tab. In PowerShell, where is the Where-Object alias, not the executable-location check. The unqualified Windows workflow also gives a cmd.exe activation command in f2. A learner following the cited Windows shell cannot perform this demonstrated verification. This is new canonical evidence slated for reuse.",
